  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Write and queue together",
      "items": [
        "the optimistic row and the queued mutation commit in one SQLite transaction — no half-written local state",
        "the local store is a projection: the server answer replaces it and the server resolves conflicts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The drain is off the GUI thread",
      "items": [
        "drains fire on startup, on reconnect and on a timer; the work runs on a worker thread and the model is updated back on the GUI thread",
        "each send carries an Idempotency-Key, so a retry applies once",
        "the reply is aborted when a newer request supersedes it, and a stale result is dropped by the request-id guard"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Failure is a value",
      "items": [
        "on error the previous value is restored and the reason is recorded — no exception crosses a slot or a layer",
        "the retry ladder is bounded and ends in a dead-letter row an admin can inspect",
        "the ViewModel shows one closed status — Offline, Error or Forbidden — never a silent empty list"
      ]
    }
  ]
